  "Le total sera recalculé et vérifié lors de l’enregistrement.": ["The total will be recalculated and verified when saving.", "El total se recalculará y verificará al guardar.", "O total será recalculado e verificado ao guardar.", "保存时将重新计算并验证总额。", "保存時に合計を再計算して確認します。"],
