  "Racontez l’histoire en au moins {count} caractères.": ["Tell the story in at least {count} characters.", "Cuenta la historia con al menos {count} caracteres.", "Conte a história com pelo menos {count} carateres.", "请用至少 {count} 个字符讲述故事。", "物語を {count} 文字以上で入力してください。"],
